                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your 83-year-old female patient, admitted on 19/11/2021 due to an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Clinical examination, chest X-ray, arterial blood gas analysis, and pulse oximetry confirmed the exacerbation. Blood tests were obtained to exclude infectious or other contributing causes. She was treated with inhaled bronchodilators via nebuliser, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and intravenous fluids. Vital signs were monitored closely throughout her stay. She responded well to treatment with improvement in respiratory function and oxygen saturation. She was discharged on 20/11/2021 in stable condition. Please continue maintenance bronchodilator therapy and arrange follow-up. I remain available for any queries.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
